✅ 5. Explain the differences

 Same Lock vs Different Locks

| Feature              | Same Lock | Different Locks |
| -------------------- | --------- | --------------- |
| One Thread at a Time | ✅ Yes    | ❌ No           |
| Concurrency          | Lower     | Higher          |
| Blocking             | More      | Less            |
| Throughput           | Lower     | Higher          |

this vs Custom Lock

| Synchronization              | Monitor Used   |
| ---------------------------- | -------------- |
| `synchronized(this)`         | Current object |
| `synchronized(lock)`         | `lock` object  |
| `synchronized(customerLock)` | Customer lock  |
| `synchronized(loanLock)`     | Loan lock      |